.TH GPS 1 2000-1月 "knockdown_residual" "knockdown_residual"
.SH NAME
knockdown_residual \- Get or set the fraction of the wild type expression that is kept by an in silico knockdown.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIknockdown_residual(\fBgps\fR as <generic> GPSModel, 
\fBresidual\fR as double = -1, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Get or set the fraction of the wild type expression that is kept by an in silico knockdown.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBgps\fB \fR\- the trained model object.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBresidual\fB \fR\- 
 the residual fraction in the range \fB[0,1)\fR; a negative value (the default) means "only
 read the current value without modifying it".
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
the currently effective residual fraction; \fB0\fR makes a knockdown identical to a knockout
 and \fB0.2\fR is the CRISPRi setting used by the Virtual Cell Challenge.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
GPS
